subckt flash_adc_3bit (VDD VSS vin clk vrefp vrefn b2 b1 b0)
CT1 (net19 VSS) capacitor c=300f
CT2 (net6 VSS) capacitor c=300f
CT3 (net1 VSS) capacitor c=300f
CT4 (net14 VSS) capacitor c=300f
CT5 (net4 VSS) capacitor c=300f
CT6 (net10 VSS) capacitor c=300f
CT7 (net7 VSS) capacitor c=300f
RL1 (net19 vrefn) resistor r=500
RL2 (net6 net19) resistor r=500
RL3 (net1 net6) resistor r=500
RL4 (net14 net1) resistor r=500
RL5 (net4 net14) resistor r=500
RL6 (net10 net4) resistor r=500
RL7 (net7 net10) resistor r=500
RL8 (vrefp net7) resistor r=500
XC1 (VDD VSS clk vin net19 net16 net3) fa_comp
XC2 (VDD VSS clk vin net6 net17 net15) fa_comp
XC3 (VDD VSS clk vin net1 net12 net26) fa_comp
XC4 (VDD VSS clk vin net14 net2 net9) fa_comp
XC5 (VDD VSS clk vin net4 net18 net23) fa_comp
XC6 (VDD VSS clk vin net10 net13 net22) fa_comp
XC7 (VDD VSS clk vin net7 net24 net5) fa_comp
XE1 (VDD VSS q2 net11) fa_inv
XE10 (VDD VSS net27 net0 net21 net25 b0) fa_nand4
XE11 (VDD VSS q4 net8) fa_inv
XE12 (VDD VSS net8 b2) fa_inv
XE2 (VDD VSS q4 n4) fa_inv
XE3 (VDD VSS q6 n6) fa_inv
XE4 (VDD VSS q7 net25) fa_inv
XE5 (VDD VSS q2 n4 net20) fa_nand2
XE6 (VDD VSS n6 net20 b1) fa_nand2
XE7 (VDD VSS q5 n6 net27) fa_nand2
XE8 (VDD VSS q3 n4 net0) fa_nand2
XE9 (VDD VSS q1 net11 net21) fa_nand2
XS1 (VDD VSS net3 net16 q1 qb1) fa_sr
XS2 (VDD VSS net15 net17 q2 qb2) fa_sr
XS3 (VDD VSS net26 net12 q3 qb3) fa_sr
XS4 (VDD VSS net9 net2 q4 qb4) fa_sr
XS5 (VDD VSS net23 net18 q5 qb5) fa_sr
XS6 (VDD VSS net22 net13 q6 qb6) fa_sr
XS7 (VDD VSS net5 net24 q7 qb7) fa_sr
